7s]`**\n   - `[12/12] cache` (`cache_ext4.img`) $\\rightarrow$ **`OKAY [8.076s]`**\n3. **Inyección del Sistema Completo `[13/13] super.img` (`1.88 GB` — `DMC.v2.25` Android 12 Liberado):**\n   - Bloques `1/11` al `11/11` enviados y escritos con **`OKAY`** (`Finished. Total time: 210.140s`, `ExitCode=0`), estructurando `TVLauncher`, `TVWall.apk` (Slimbox), `AppDMC`, `DLStore`, `HDPlay`, `Filemanager`, `ControlDevice` y `Google Play Store`.\n4. **Limpieza, Reinicio Automático y Visto Bueno (`[PASO 4/4]`):**\n   - `fastboot erase cache` $\\rightarrow$ **`OKAY [0.066s]`**\n   - `fastboot erase userdata` $\\rightarrow$ **`OKAY [0.504s]`**\n   - `fastboot reboot` $\\rightarrow$ **`Rebooting OKAY`**\n   - **`[PASO 4/4] ¡VISTO BUENO FASTBOOT APROBADO (13/13 PARTICIONES + SUPER.IMG)!`**\n\nVerifica la pantalla de tu TV: la caja **`Z41221040106995`** ya debe estar iniciando directamente con el logo y la interfaz completa del firmware liberado **`DMC.v2.25`**. ¿También quieres que le pasemos esta misma actualización completa con `super.img` (`1.88 GB`) a la primera caja (`Z41220110063684`)?","thinking":"Initial hypothesis centered on potential inconsistencies in the handler, specifically a port mismatch. Examining the end-to-end log reveals a crucial detail: the box `Z412210` is consistently failing within the specified timeframe. This strongly suggests the problem is isolated to this specific component, potentially indicating a configuration error or runtime issue.\n\n\nAnalyzing the bootloader output, the system appears to be successfully writing images to the device via Fastboot. All image writes completed without errors, suggesting the root cause isn't at this low level. However, the consistent \"100% without TTL\" observation is notable. This needs further investigation in the context of the device's expected behavior during this phase. The successful unlocking and image writes indicate the underlying hardware is accessible.\n\n\nThe Fastboot output shows successful image